        "id": 1014288
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-18T18:48:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, the reason for UNKNOWN as an option is for forward compatibility. go/android-api-guidelines#return-error\n\nApps that receive this, if they haven\u0027t updated to handle the new algorithm, will break in unexpected ways. In general, you won\u0027t use UNKNOWN.",
      "parentUuid": "62fee391_40a212d5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 523,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 533,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "d992f8b7fe9dbbaf004ed589fd3948f44cee79ca",
