      "writtenOn": "2024-11-18T19:56:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems that section applies to methods, not the fields in intents.\n\nIrrespective, what value would we assign to `UNKNOWN`?\nIf we assign it `3` today, then what value should the new encryption algo should be assigned in future? Would we then have to change the value of the `UNKNOWN`? Wouldn\u0027t that be a break?\nIf we retain the value of `UNKNOWN` and assign new encryption algo a new number, say `4`, then this question would need to be answered for the next encryption algo as well.",
      "parentUuid": "04f47df3_ef1419d4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 523,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 533,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "d992f8b7fe9dbbaf004ed589fd3948f44cee79ca",
